  "description": "An Anaconda the Bureau of Continuity had rebuilt as a cruiser for people, not cargo: most of the hold gave way to quarters, and a saloon rises on her crest, falling away to the tail like a grand tourer's roof. Fast, and hard to hold on a scanner. Six were converted; one was never returned.",
