    "aiAssisted": true,
    "notes": "Original Witchspace geometry: our Anaconda's hull, with a saloon raised on her crest towards the stern, a steep front and a roof falling to the tail, in the spirit of a 1960s British grand tourer and a gentleman's motor yacht. Nothing traced from any real car, yacht or film."
